  "Ming confirms the investiture of {0}": "Ming potwierdza inwestyturę {0}",
  "Ming court admonishes {0}": "Sąd Ming upomina {0}",
  "Ming court brokers peace among tributaries": "Sąd Ming zapewnia pokój między dopływami",
  "Ming court censures {0}": "Sąd w Ming potępia {0}",
  "Ming Empire": "Imperium Minga",
  "Ming maritime prohibition": "Zakaz morski Ming",
  "Ming ports are now open to your nation's lawful trade": "Porty Ming są teraz otwarte dla legalnego handlu twojego kraju",
